  "description": "Correlation-based trackers have shown promising performance using hand-crafted features (<em>e.g.,</em> HOG).\n                When adopting deep features for correlation-based trackers, the bottleneck is the computing costs for CNN feature extraction.\n                We propose a deep feature compression method for high-speed and high-accuracy visual tracker."
